; The commit subject `npm version <level>` would write (docs/internal/RELEASE-DISCIPLINE.md).
; npm commits only when `.git` is in its current directory; this plugin is a
; subdirectory, so step 5 of the release sequence writes the same subject by
; hand. The release guard (scripts/verify-release-pushed.mjs RELEASE_SUBJECT)
; watches for this prefix, so a bump that sits unpushed is reported.
message=release(sdlc-workflow): v%s
